nese. There really isnt a more international feel to it in my opinion.</div> </div> </div> </div>By &quot;Hogwarts&quot; I didn't mean &quot;Britain.&quot;<br /> <br /> I meant &quot;a magical boarding school filled with secrets, dangers, and interesting things to see and characters to meet.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-28T14:00:13-07:00","id":994812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/994662-highschool-of-the-gods?p=994771#post994771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, got your yandere spot filled pretty easily with that one XD</div> </div> </div> </div>... *SIGHS and makes another entry in the Big Book O' Character Concepts*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-28T14:54:27-07:00","id":994864,"title":"","content":"Y'know, if I were <i>ever</i> going to do a game where all the characters are in highschool, Scion would probably be it. I'd set it somewhere in the Americas, though, I imagine. Try as I might, Life is Strange and Gravity Falls would probably make it into the inspiration list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-28T16:17:03-07:00","id":994928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/994662-highschool-of-the-gods?p=994864#post994864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Life is Strange</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0